WEBVTT

00:04:59.262 --> 00:05:01.787
because we are just
at the beginning of the path.

00:05:01.811 --> 00:05:05.409
But we want to share
what was the key learning,

00:05:05.433 --> 00:05:07.691
the key learning that Mario drove to us,

00:05:07.715 --> 00:05:10.035
and it is to consider
what you have as a gift

00:05:10.059 --> 00:05:14.723
and not only what you miss,

00:05:14.747 --> 00:05:18.916
and to consider what you
miss just as an opportunity.

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:21.560
And this is the message
that we want to share with you.

00:05:21.584 --> 00:05:25.296
This is why we are here.

00:05:25.320 --> 00:05:27.211
Mario!

00:05:27.235 --> 00:05:28.974
And this is why --

00:05:28.998 --> 00:05:33.576
(Applause) —